# Notion — Prayer App Biz (this repo only)

This workspace is **`Kelemek/Prayer_App`** (multi-tenant SaaS). It is **not** Cross Pointe church production.

When creating or updating Notion pages, issues, feedback, or roadmap rows for work done **in this repo**, use **Prayer App Biz** only:

- Hub: **Prayer App Biz** (🙏)
- **Product → Build roadmap** — shipped features, backports, eng milestones (e.g. Backport CP polish)
